ffload_device 并且使其与 device 不同。\nswap_io_components：卸载输入/输出嵌入和归一化层\n\n结合 blocks_to_swap 可进一步节省 VRAM\n需要设置 offload_device 并且使其与 device 不同。\nattention_mode：注意力计算后端\n\nsdpa: PyTorch scaled_dot_product_attention（默认值，稳定，始终可用）\nflash_attnFlash Attention 2（在支持的硬件上速度更快，需要 flash-attn 软件包）\ntorch_compile_args：连接到 SeedVR2 Torch 编译设置节点，可提升 20-40% 的速度。\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [620.6390380859375, 641.826171875], "pos": [5025.09130859375, 979.080810546875], "id": 142, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [313], "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}, {"name": "CLIP", "links": [319], "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "CLIP"}], "size": [446.61761474609375, 246], "pos": [2982.792236328125, 1503.32373046875], "widgets_values": ["Kook_Zimage_真实幻想_Turbo.safetensors", 0.8000000000000002, "None", 1.0000000000000002, "None", 1, "None", 1], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 332, "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}, {"name": "clip", "link": 333, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "lora_01"}, "name": "lora_01", "label": "lora_01", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "LoRA_01"}, {"widget": {"name": "strength_01"}, "name": "strength_01", "label": "strength_01", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "强度_01"}, {"widget": {"name": "lora_02"}, "name": "lora_02", "label": "lora_02", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "LoRA_02"}, {"widget": {"name": "strength_02"}, "name": "strength_02", "label": "strength_02", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "强度_02"}, {"widget": {"name": "lora_03"}, "name": "lora_03", "label": "lora_03", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "LoRA_03"}, {"widget": {"name": "strength_03"}, "name": "strength_03", "label": "strength_03", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "强度_03"}, {"widget": {"name": "lora_04"}, "name": "lora_04", "label": "lora_04", "ty